{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"84477","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/84477","key":"MC-236740","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"15/Sep/21 5:27 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>A large server-side lag spike sometimes occurs when opening/breaking a chest containing a  map or executing <tt>/locate buried_treasure</tt>. This affects both shipwrecks and underwater ruins. In some cases, the lag spike can be so severe that it can last upwards of 30 seconds, and some users have reported crashes.</p>\n\n<p>If the server fails to locate a nearby buried treasure, it generates an empty map instead of a buried treasure map (\n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-238484\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-238484\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Treasure map not generated in ship wrecks and ocean ruines\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-238484\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n).</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Toreproduce\"></a>To reproduce</h3>\n<p>This occurs for a noticeable portion of shipwrecks/underwater ruins, but the seed and coordinates below are particularly good examples.</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Create a world with one of the following seed and coordinates:\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>Seed: 5120366084678867272\nCoordinates: /execute in minecraft:overworld run tp @s 1303.51 49.00 4016.70 178.65 27.45</pre>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>Seed: -1899573754757393022\nCoordinates (shipwreck): /execute in minecraft:overworld run tp @s 2843.30 60.63 -977.73 255.15 36.00\nCoordinates (underwater ruins): /execute in minecraft:overworld run tp @s 2263.13 41.86 -1161.19 264.75 52.80\n</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li>Wait for the teleportation lag to finish.</li>\n\t<li>Open the chest.<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> A massive server-side lag spike occurs.</li>\n</ol>\n","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"27/Sep/21 10:20 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/109425","id":"109425","filename":"2021-09-15_21.31.05.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png"},"displayName":"ampolive","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"15/Sep/21 5:31 PM","size":"245 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/